Hello modders and mappers, here is Indytotof.
After few reflexion, there is a topic to explain my mod:
First of all, the inspiration of the mod come from for several reasons: Playing the + 123 mod with the Evolved mod (both containing
here
and
here
) and a wish to modified the game (for the first time, only for me, but now not only).
So there is the modifications bring by the mod:
- The Emperor as CIS hero on Coruscant;
- Yoda as the Alliance hero on Coruscant;
- Urban units for the rebels on Coruscant and Naboo;
- Asajj Ventress as the CIS hero on Felucia, Kashyyyk and Yavin 4;
- New maps for Grievous: Death Star and Polis Massa (because he can breath outside);
- The Emperor as Empire hero on Mygeeto, Felucia and Utapau (due to the Order 66);
- Darth Vader as Empire hero on Kashyyyk, Yavin 4, Death Star and Polis Massa (because, as Grievous, he can breath outside);
- A total new hero for the Alliance: Ben Kenobi (playable on the Death Star and Polis Massa);
- Rebels units more accurate to the 4th movie on Yavin 4 (Fleet Riffleman, Desert Rocketeer, Pilot engineer, Fleet sniper, regular Bothan officer);
- Ep2 Clones on Yavin 4, Mos Eisley (due to the Clone Wars serie), Polis Massa and Kamino;
- Felucia sniper on Mustafar for the Republic;
- Playable Ep2 Clone commander;
- "Rebel Smuggler" rename as "Rebel Engineer";
- More maps for Dooku: Mustafar and Jabba's Palace;
- New hero for the Republic: Anakin Skywalker (Yavin 4, Mos Eisley, Mustafar and Jabba's Palace);
- New skin for Darth Maul more close to the season 5 of The Clone Wars (modification almost over);
- ATST pilot for the Empire on all the map except on the Death Star, Hoth and Mygeeto;
- Obi-Wan Kenobi now playable on Polis Massa for the Republic;
- Snow troopers for the Alliance and the Empire on Mygeeto;
- Hoth Luke on Mygeeto;
- Pilot Luke now playable on Yavin 4;
- Death Star Reinforcement fix supported in the mod;
- A new officer for the Empire (the regular one is only playable on Hoth and Mygeeto).
Some screens of the modification bring by the mod:
Hidden/Spoiler:
To make the mod fully enjoyable, you'll need the Evolved mod (since my mod use it as base) and the v1.3 r129 patch.
There is two little things to fix:
- Darth Maul model to complete (adding a skirt, new animation and a blacksaber);
- A munging problem resuming as these
Code:
Select all
/Common was not expecting at this time
(problem solved).
After these two fix, the mod will be complete.

